@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+'@module-federation/runtime-core': minor
+'@module-federation/runtime': minor
+'@module-federation/inject-external-runtime-core-plugin': minor
+'@module-federation/rspack': minor
+'@module-federation/sdk': minor
+'@module-federation/enhanced': patch
+'@module-federation/webpack-bundler-runtime': patch
+---
+
+Add immutable runtime-image v1 metadata and admission helpers to the runtime core and kernel. Validate supplied metadata before state construction, publication, or reuse while retaining unchecked legacy reuse when metadata is absent.
+
+Rspack external-runtime builds can opt into an image profile with explicit ABI and entry-loader guarantees, an explicit runtime target, and the built-in runtime without opaque plugins. Default/global external consumers validate the published image before namespace access. Metadata-aware admission through other external transport types has a named unsupported-boundary error; untagged transports retain their existing resolution.
